  "details": "For about 2 years at thsi point, it was under review for VRChat to have the option of using the trackpad to do gesture overrides instead of using individual finger tracking. Allowing people to choose how they want to have their gesture bindings would help many who may have a physical disability that would prevent them from forming certain gestures. It would also help those moving from the older HTC Vive Controllers get used to the Valve Index Controls. If not natively supported in game allow users to customize these settings in the SteamVR controller binding set up",
